{"synopsis":"Nagi Kujo, Seorang Dokter birilian yang merawat pasien di zona konflik tanpa kenal lelah, pulang ke kampung halamannya, Jepang, untuk mengobati ayah angkatnya, seorang dermawan yang dulu menyelamatkan dirinya. Namun, pada saat kedatangannya, dia menemukan bahwa ayahnya dibunuh oleh sosok yang tidak dikenal. Dengan tekadnya untuk menyingkap kebenaran, Nagi mulai menyelidiki misteri yang menyelimuti kematian ayahnya.","alternative_title":"Black Surge","author":"TSUDA Houkou","artist":"MARUYAMA Takayuki","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"3c483e2f-e358-4df8-be16-0be99e6ad849","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2025-11-11","released":"2025-11-11","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_39/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"088253b6-46c7-455e-969e-d8bb3c827401","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2025-11-11","released":"2025-11-11","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_38/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_9b1717f4-58b9-4fb5-9b2b-5c76702bde81/chapter_ch_38/2.w